   "title": "interior DETAILS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>The interior of the cabin was full of era-accurate decor, camp bunk beds, trunks, lamps, and Jason’s hidden camp sack. Our forest area was filled with foliage, eerie lighting, and a practical shed facade. The interior of Jason's shed was dimly lit with a dead hippie immediately discoverable on entrance as well as knick knacks left behind including lanterns, Chuckles candy bars, and a toy laser gun.&nbsp;</p>"
