  {
   "title": "IMMERSIVE BEAT 1",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Guests queued through an immersive pre-show before Barry and Claudette welcomed them as the camp’s newest counselors and brought them inside for orientation. Orientation broke down when a panicked hippie burst in searching for her missing friend, pulling Barry away to chase down a prop thief and leaving Claudette alone with Pam Voorhees.</p>"
    },
