  {
   "title": "immersive beat 2",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Pam uncovered Jason’s machete mid-rant, and a scream outside sent Claudette running back in to report a body in the woods - then Pam snapped, launching the central scare and sending guests fleeing toward Jason’s shed. Fleeing through the woods, the group found a frightened Barry and the hippies’ body among the trees as they reached the entrance to Jason’s shed.</p>"
