  {
   "title": "immersive beat 3",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Inside, the lights cut out and Pam reappeared for one final scare (triggering our “scream” photo opp) before Sheriff Brooks arrived and she vanished.&nbsp;On the way out, a BA handed guests a custom Crystal Lake bandana, and guests could complete a consumer insights survey for an exclusive “Pam’s Bloody Sweater” pin.</p>"
